_*/
# Build output. `*/` above already covers the top level; the `**/` forms cover
# the nested cases (Demo/Service/packages, Sample1/bin, ...).
packages/
**/packages/
# Tooling/editor state. This used to be a blanket `.*/`, which silently ignored
# every dot-directory -- including .github/, so no workflow, no dependabot
# configuration, no issue template and no security advisory could ever be
# committed. Keep the list explicit; add to it, do not wildcard it.
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.licenser/
# Never ignore these: they are part of the product.
!.github/
*.mdb
**/bin/
**/obj/
*.suo
Build/build.fsx
AltCover/Properties/launchSettings.json
*/coverage.opencover.xml
